---
/**
 * Intro loader — the official FPA logo, revealed line by line.
 *
 * The mark (fotta / popadič / architekt) is inlined from the designer's
 * SVG (master copy: public/images/logo-fpa.svg) — every letter is its
 * own path. Each of the three lines sits inside an SVG clipPath band
 * and rises into it from below, exactly the word-mask reveal the old
 * text lockup used. fill="currentColor" → the mark follows --ink in
 * both themes.
 *
 * Animation logic lives in src/scripts/loader.ts (same choreography
 * and timings as the previous house + wordmark version).
 */
---

